WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.602
-There's a lot going on
right now.

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:04.437
People are still stressed
about the election,

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:06.839
and I think we could all use a
break, so right now we'd like to

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:08.908
show you some uplifting,
creative videos,

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:10.610
whether they come from
quarantine

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.545
or just stuff from
around the country.

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:15.514
It's time for "What Are You
Doing Wednesday?"

00:00:15.514 --> 00:00:17.817
♪ -What are you doing
next Wednesday? ♪

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:21.621
♪ What are you doing
next Wednesday? ♪

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:24.757
-First up...
[ Laughs ]

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:28.427
This is good. I've never seen
a cat relax like this.

00:00:28.427 --> 00:00:29.662
Check this out.

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:33.165 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:33.165 --> 00:00:34.701
He's on his back.

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:39.105
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:40.607
Look at that.

00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:46.246
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.246 --> 00:00:48.081
Yeah, I tell ya.

00:00:48.081 --> 00:00:51.384
[ Applause ]

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:53.653
I've never seen a cat
on his back like that, man.

00:00:53.653 --> 00:00:56.756
That looks like me three days
into my vacation in Mexico.

00:00:56.756 --> 00:00:58.291
[ Laughter ]
Actually it looks like me

00:00:58.291 --> 00:01:00.726
20 minutes into my vacation
in Mexico.

00:01:00.726 --> 00:01:03.896
Next up, this toucan
was hoping to have

00:01:03.896 --> 00:01:06.966
some of its owner's breakfast
but ran into some trouble.

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:08.234
Watch this.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.236
-You're actually not allowed
to have doughnuts.

00:01:12.638 --> 00:01:13.973
No.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:16.809
You're not allowed
to have doughnuts.

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:19.045
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:21.347
-Alright, so...
[ Applause ]

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:24.150
Froot Loops, yes, doughnuts, no?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:26.319
What are the rules?!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:28.787
Tell me the rules.

00:01:28.787 --> 00:01:31.657
Next up, Halloween may be over,
but this woman

00:01:31.657 --> 00:01:34.394
seems to like scaring
her husband year-round.

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:35.695
Watch this.

00:01:40.967 --> 00:01:42.569
[ Car alarm blaring ]
-Aah!

00:01:42.569 --> 00:01:49.909
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:53.079
[ Applause ]

00:01:53.079 --> 00:01:55.347
