"Well, someone's horny."

00:01:55.347 --> 00:01:56.516
[ Laughter and groaning ]

00:01:56.516 --> 00:01:58.484
What? Car horny!

00:01:58.484 --> 00:01:59.852
What are the rules?!

00:01:59.852 --> 00:02:01.253
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.253 --> 00:02:03.589
What are the rules?

00:02:03.589 --> 00:02:06.592
And finally, this bulldog...
[ Laughs ]

00:02:06.592 --> 00:02:07.893
I just like this.

00:02:07.893 --> 00:02:10.362
This bulldog just wanted to
relax on his hammock.

00:02:10.362 --> 00:02:12.031
That doesn't make any sense,
but anyways.

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:14.400
The bulldog just wanted to relax
on a hammock,

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:17.002
but luck wasn't on his side.

00:02:17.002 --> 00:02:19.071
Just check out this guy.

00:02:19.071 --> 00:02:21.039
Come on, buddy. Come on, bud.

00:02:21.039 --> 00:02:23.576
Come on, bud! Whoa! Nope.

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:27.279 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:27.279 --> 00:02:28.681
There he goes. Oh, no!

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:38.324
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:39.558
